		(property "Note" "16-bit DAC, +/-5 V range on VDD/VSS = +/-12 V (bipolar ranges need VDD 4.75-16.5 V, VSS -16.5-0 V [DS]). SDO shared with the ADC on ISO_MISO (tri-state while SYNC high [DS]). LDAC tied low: output updates on the SYNC rising edge. Sourcing checked 2026-11-07 [LCSC API / DigiKey CA web]: LCSC C515877 (592 pcs, $13.03; tube C404015 20 pcs), DigiKey AD5761RBRUZ-RL7 (751 pcs, C$25.57)"
			(at 198.12 109.22 0)
			(hide yes)
