		(uuid "03907e20-6073-4fe8-b658-5cf974f5c65d")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D3:\nControl pins: LDAC tied to DGND (DAC register updates when SYNC rises). CLEAR, RESET pulled to +3V3 (internal pull-ups exist; the 10k make the nets probe-able and let Rev 2 safety logic drive them). CLEAR (falling edge) sets the output to zero / mid / full scale per the control register: a candidate hard-wired clear from ISO_ENABLE low in Rev 2. ALERT open-drain, TP33."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
