	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE L1:\nC107 / C109 / C111 at pins 8, 6, 15 with the via at the pad, C108 / C110 next to them on the rail side; C106 at pin 4 with a short return to AGND. AGND and DGND on the same ground plane under the part. DAC_CMD short to RS1 on [6]."
