	(text_box "MISC NOTE M1:\nSPI: 24-bit frames, SYNC low, data on SCLK falling edge, SCLK <= 50 MHz [DS]; write the control register first (range, CLR mode, overrange off), then input register 0x8000 = 0 V. Read-back: SDO drives ISO_MISO only while SYNC is low. Bring-up (R5 on the acceptance table): code sweep vs DMM on TP13 DAC_CMD. Sourcing checked 2026-11-07 [LCSC API / DigiKey CA web]: see U40 field notes."
